{"id":"e3f03b61d14b0916","group":"58","path":"58/batch07/58-df-zfc-forcing3-maximal-antichain-refinement.md","title":"ZFC Forcing3 Maximal Antichain Refinement","display":"df-zfc-forcing3-maximal-antichain-refinement — ZFC Forcing3 Maximal Antichain Refinement","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-forcing3-maximal-antichain-refinement","aliases":["58-df-zfc-forcing3-maximal-antichain-refinement"],"display":"df-zfc-forcing3-maximal-antichain-refinement — ZFC Forcing3 Maximal Antichain Refinement","depends_on":["[[../batch01/58-df-maximal-antichain.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-forcing3-maximal-antichain-refinement"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-forcing3-maximal-antichain-refinement</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-forcing3-maximal-antichain-refinement — ZFC Forcing3 Maximal Antichain Refinement"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"fb7c32a0f0383968\" href=\"?note=fb7c32a0f0383968\" title=\"../batch01/58-df-maximal-antichain.md\">../batch01/58-df-maximal-antichain.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb P\">\\(\\mathbb P\\)</span> (forcing-poset carrier)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\leq_{\\mathbb P}\\subseteq\\mathbb P\\times\\mathbb P\">\\(\\leq_{\\mathbb P}\\subseteq\\mathbb P\\times\\mathbb P\\)</span> (forcing order)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\subseteq\\mathbb P\">\\(A,B\\subseteq\\mathbb P\\)</span> (candidate maximal antichains)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{MaxAntichain}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{MaxAntichain}_S\\)</span> (maximal-antichain predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"fb7c32a0f0383968\" href=\"?note=fb7c32a0f0383968\" title=\"../batch01/58-df-maximal-antichain.md\">../batch01/58-df-maximal-antichain.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{AntichainRefines}_S\">\\(\\operatorname{AntichainRefines}_S\\)</span> (oriented refinement predicate defined below)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{MaxAntichainRefines}\">\\(\\operatorname{MaxAntichainRefines}\\)</span> (predicate defined below)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}forcing3\\text{-}antichain\\text{-}refines} \\vdash \\operatorname{AntichainRefines}_S(B,A,\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P})\\leftrightarrow A,B\\subseteq\\mathbb P\\land\\forall b\\in B\\;\\exists a\\in A\\;(b\\leq_{\\mathbb P}a)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}forcing3\\text{-}antichain\\text{-}refines} \\vdash \\operatorname{AntichainRefines}_S(B,A,\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P})\\leftrightarrow A,B\\subseteq\\mathbb P\\land\\forall b\\in B\\;\\exists a\\in A\\;(b\\leq_{\\mathbb P}a)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}forcing3\\text{-}maximal\\text{-}antichain\\text{-}refinement} \\vdash \\operatorname{MaxAntichainRefines}(B,A,\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P})\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{MaxAntichain}_S(A,\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P})\\land\\mathrm{MaxAntichain}_S(B,\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P})\\land\\operatorname{AntichainRefines}_S(B,A,\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P})\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}forcing3\\text{-}maximal\\text{-}antichain\\text{-}refinement} \\vdash \\operatorname{MaxAntichainRefines}(B,A,\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P})\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{MaxAntichain}_S(A,\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P})\\land\\mathrm{MaxAntichain}_S(B,\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P})\\land\\operatorname{AntichainRefines}_S(B,A,\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P})\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The order relation is an explicit argument to both maximal-antichain predicates. The auxiliary predicate fixes the orientation: <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\">\\(B\\)</span> refines <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> exactly when every <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"b\\in B\">\\(b\\in B\\)</span> strengthens some <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a\\in A\">\\(a\\in A\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch01/58-df-maximal-antichain.md","status":"resolved","id":"fb7c32a0f0383968","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch01/58-df-maximal-antichain.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch01/58-df-maximal-antichain.md","status":"resolved","id":"fb7c32a0f0383968","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{MaxAntichain}_S$ (maximal-antichain predicate, see [[../batch01/58-df-maximal-antichain.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathbb P","display":false},{"tex":"\\leq_{\\mathbb P}\\subseteq\\mathbb P\\times\\mathbb P","display":false},{"tex":"A,B\\subseteq\\mathbb P","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{MaxAntichain}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{AntichainRefines}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{MaxAntichainRefines}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}forcing3\\text{-}antichain\\text{-}refines} \\vdash \\operatorname{AntichainRefines}_S(B,A,\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P})\\leftrightarrow A,B\\subseteq\\mathbb P\\land\\forall b\\in B\\;\\exists a\\in A\\;(b\\leq_{\\mathbb P}a)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}forcing3\\text{-}maximal\\text{-}antichain\\text{-}refinement} \\vdash \\operatorname{MaxAntichainRefines}(B,A,\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P})\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{MaxAntichain}_S(A,\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P})\\land\\mathrm{MaxAntichain}_S(B,\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P})\\land\\operatorname{AntichainRefines}_S(B,A,\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P})","display":true},{"tex":"B","display":false},{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"b\\in B","display":false},{"tex":"a\\in A","display":false}],"bytes":1708,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-2078","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch07/58-df-zfc-forcing3-maximal-antichain-refinement.md|58-df-zfc-forcing3-maximal-antichain-refinement]]（batch07）"}],"outgoing":["fb7c32a0f0383968"]}